# Line ending policy: CRLF in repository AND working directory
#
# `-text` disables all end-of-line conversion → blobs keep working-tree bytes as-is
# (this repo standardises on CRLF), and the behaviour no longer depends on each
# machine's core.autocrlf, which cannot be distributed with the repository.
#
# ⚠️ Do NOT use `* text eol=crlf` here: that normalises blobs to LF in the repository,
#    which is the opposite of this policy.

* -text

# Binary files - no normalization
*.dll binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.scmod binary
*.jks binary
*.pak binary
*.db binary
